MID_CmdBtl_RestartBattle_GmapCasual_Annotation: If you select No, you will return to Dagsion with all units at 1 HP.
MID_CmdBtl_RestartBattle_GmapClassic_Annotation: If you select No, all units in the squad will be defeated and lost,\nincluding units not participating in the clash. ({CapitalizeNextLetter}{AvatarName}'s\nHP will be reduced to 1, and you will return to Dagsion.)
